=== CHANGES ===
Migrated cmd\teslasync\main.go warmup loop:
  - Replaced legacy signal_history per-signal lookup with stateReader.State (forward-fold; no DISTINCT-ON holes).
  - Moved stateReader construction to before the FleetTelemetry conditional (line ~269) so warmup + router share one instance.
  - Per-vehicle 10s context.WithTimeout (was 30s shared across whole loop). Hard cap so a single misbehaving vehicle cannot stall startup.
  - Per-vehicle partial-failure tolerance: warn+continue instead of aborting; missed vehicles hydrate from next live telemetry batch.
  - Loop kept SEQUENTIAL: pgx pool MaxConns~25 cannot absorb a vehicle-fan-out parallel scan during the startup window. Parallelism is a separate optimization.
  - Explicit map copy from signal.State (map[string]signal.SignalValue) into map[string]interface{} for signalStore.Hydrate (named-type identity rule).
